#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php
msgid ""
"AI returned a response outside the required translation JSON contract. "
"WordPress content remains unchanged; retry the translation."
msgstr ""
"AI a returnat un răspuns care nu respectă structura JSON obligatorie pentru"
" traduceri. Conținutul WordPress rămâne nemodificat; reîncearcă traducerea."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php
msgid ""
"AI returned an empty excerpt for a source item that has one. Run the draft "
"again or choose another text model."
msgstr ""
"AI a returnat un extras gol pentru un element-sursă care are unul. Rulează "
"din nou crearea ciornei sau alege alt model text."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php
msgid ""
"AI returned an empty localized term name. Run the draft again or choose "
"another text model."
msgstr ""
"AI a returnat un nume de termen localizat gol. Rulează din nou crearea "
"ciornei sau alege alt model text."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php
msgid ""
"AI returned an empty string translation. Run the suggestion again or choose"
" another text model."
msgstr ""
"AI a returnat o traducere de șir goală. Rulează din nou sugestia sau alege "
"alt model text."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php
msgid ""
"AI returned an empty term description for a source term that has one. Run "
"the draft again or choose another text model."
msgstr ""
"AI a returnat o descriere de termen goală pentru un termen-sursă care are "
"una. Rulează din nou ciorna sau alege alt model text."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php
msgid ""
"AI returned an empty title. Run the draft again or choose another text "
"model."
msgstr "AI a returnat un titlu gol. Rulează din nou ciorna sau alege alt model text."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-content-segments.php
msgid ""
"AI returned an empty translation for a required page segment. Source "
"content remains unchanged; run the draft again or choose another text "
"model."
msgstr ""
"AI a returnat o traducere goală pentru un segment obligatoriu al paginii. "
"Conținutul-sursă rămâne nemodificat; rulează din nou ciorna sau alege alt "
"model text."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-content-segments.php
#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php
msgid ""
"AI returned an incomplete structured localization set. WordPress content "
"remains unchanged; retry the staged translation."
msgstr ""
"AI a returnat un set incomplet de localizare structurată. Conținutul "
"WordPress rămâne nemodificat; reîncearcă traducerea etapizată."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php
msgid ""
"AI returned an invalid structured segment value. Source content remains "
"unchanged; run the draft again or choose another text model."
msgstr ""
"AI a returnat o valoare nevalidă pentru un segment de localizare "
"structurată. Conținutul WordPress rămâne nemodificat; rulează din nou "
"ciorna sau alege alt model text."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php
msgid "AI returned an unknown protected token. The suggestion was rejected."
msgstr "AI a returnat un token protejat necunoscut. Sugestia a fost respinsă."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-content-segments.php
msgid ""
"AI returned an unknown structured localization segment. Source content "
"remains unchanged; verify the selected model and run the draft again."
msgstr ""
